*   s114 WITNESS — EVAL of a LITERAL ARITHMETIC expression inside a DEFINE'd function.
*   m3 returns the SECOND OPERAND, never the sum (1+2=2, 1+5=5, 10+20=20): a one-cell
*   offset error in the CLASS-C frame's declined-node reads.  m4 PASSES — m3-only,
*   so this is also a GOAL-MODE34-IDENTICAL violation.  Pre-existing under
*   SCRIP_CHAIN_FRAME=0, where the same shape is an unanalyzable SIG11 instead.
        DEFINE('F(x)')
        OUTPUT = F('ignored')
        :(END)
F       F = EVAL('1 + 2')                              :(RETURN)
END
